+		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_CHANGED_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_RAGNAR_LODBROK_1</Tag>
+		<English>Hail and well met, [CT_NAME]! I am [OUR_NAME], ruler of the glorious [OUR_CIV_SHORT].  So tell me: does [CT_CIV_SHORT] have a lot of rich and unprotected coastal cities, or what?</English>
+		<French>Bonjour, [CT_NAME], c'est un vrai plaisir ! Je suis [OUR_NAME], chef des glorieux [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Dites-moi : est-ce que [CT_CIV_SHORT] dispose de nombreuses villes c&#244;ti&#232;res riches et faiblement prot&#233;g&#233;es ?</French>
+		<German>Tag auch, [CT_NAME]! Ich bin [OUR_NAME], Staatsoberhaupt des ruhmreichen Volkes von [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. Nun, dann erz&#228;hlt mal: Besitzt Ihr vielleicht ein paar reiche, schutzlose K&#252;stenst&#228;dte?</German>
+		<Italian>Salute a te, [CT_NAME]! Io sono [OUR_NAME], glorioso sovrano [OUR_CIV_ADJ]. Parliamo, dunque: [CT_CIV_SHORT] ha molte citt&#224; costiere ricche e poco protette, vero?</Italian>
+		<Spanish>Saludos y bienaventuranzas, [CT_NAME]. Soy [OUR_NAME], dirigente de la gloriosa tierra de [OUR_CIV_SHORT].  Decidme, &#191;tiene o no [CT_CIV_SHORT] muchas ciudades costeras pr&#243;speras e indefensas?</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_SCIENTIFIC_METHOD_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Scientific Method[COLOR_REVERT] reveals the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Oil[COLOR_REVERT] resource and allows construction of the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Forest Preserve[COLOR_REVERT] improvement. It makes the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Great Library[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]The Parthenon[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]The Temple of Artemis[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monasteries[COLOR_REVERT] obsolete.</English>
+		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]M&#233;thode scientifique[COLOR_REVERT] fait appara&#238;tre les gisements de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]p&#233;trole[COLOR_REVERT] sur la carte et permet de construire une [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]R&#233;serve foresti&#232;re[COLOR_REVERT]. Elle entra&#238;ne l'obsolescence de la [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Grande biblioth&#232;que[COLOR_REVERT], du [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Parth&#233;non[COLOR_REVERT], du [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Temple d'Art&#233;mis[COLOR_REVERT] et des [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]monast&#232;res[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Wissenschaftliche Methode[COLOR_REVERT] deckt die Ressource [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]&#214;l[COLOR_REVERT] auf und erm&#246;glicht den Bau des [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Aufforstungsgebiets[COLOR_REVERT]. Die [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Gro&#223;e Bibliothek[COLOR_REVERT], der [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Parthenon[COLOR_REVERT], der [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Artemis-Tempel[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Kloster[COLOR_REVERT] werden dadurch veraltet.</German>
+		<Italian>Il [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Metodo scientifico[COLOR_REVERT] rivela le risorse di [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Petrolio[COLOR_REVERT] e permette la costruzione del miglioramento [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Riserve forestali[COLOR_REVERT]. Inoltre rende obsoleti [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]la Grande Biblioteca[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]il Partenone[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]il Tempio di Artemide[COLOR_REVERT] e i [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monasteri[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]M&#233;todo cient&#237;fico[COLOR_REVERT] revela el recurso del [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Petr&#243;leo[COLOR_REVERT] y permite la construcci&#243;n de la mejora de la [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Reserva forestal[COLOR_REVERT]. Deja obsoletos la [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Gran Biblioteca[COLOR_REVERT], el [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Parten&#243;n[COLOR_REVERT], el [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Templo de Artemisa[COLOR_REVERT] y los [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monasterios[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_UTOPIA_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Communism[COLOR_REVERT] enables the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]State Property[COLOR_REVERT] civic and [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Permanent Alliances[COLOR_REVERT]. It also allows construction of the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Intelligence Agency[COLOR_REVERT] building and the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Kremlin[COLOR_REVERT] world wonder. The first to research [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Communism[COLOR_REVERT] receives a free [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Great Spy[COLOR_REVERT] unit.</English>
+		<French>Le [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]communisme[COLOR_REVERT] permet d'instaurer la [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]nationalisation[COLOR_REVERT] et les [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]alliances permanentes[COLOR_REVERT]. Il permet aussi la construction des merveilles suivantes : l'[COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Agence de renseignements[COLOR_REVERT] et le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Kremlin[COLOR_REVERT]. Le premier &#224; d&#233;couvrir le [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Communisme[COLOR_REVERT] re&#231;oit gratuitement un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Espion illustre[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Der [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Kommunismus[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht die Einf&#252;hrung der Staatsform [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Staatseigentum[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Allianzen[COLOR_REVERT]. Das Geb&#228;ude [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Geheimdienst[COLOR_REVERT] und das Weltwunder [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Kreml[COLOR_REVERT] k&#246;nnen gebaut werden. Wer den [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Kommunismus[COLOR_REVERT] zuerst erforscht, erh&#228;lt einen [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gro&#223;en Spion[COLOR_REVERT] umsonst.</German>
+		<Italian>Il [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Comunismo[COLOR_REVERT] permette la realizzazione della forma di governo [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Propriet&#224; statale[COLOR_REVERT] e delle [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]alleanze permanenti[COLOR_REVERT]. Inoltre permette la costruzione dei [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Servizi segreti[COLOR_REVERT] e della Meraviglia [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Cremlino[COLOR_REVERT]. La prima civilt&#224; che ricerca il [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Comunismo[COLOR_REVERT] riceve anche una [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Grande spia[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Comunismo[COLOR_REVERT] activa el principio de la [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Propiedad estatal[COLOR_REVERT], as&#237; como las [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Alianzas permanentes[COLOR_REVERT]. Permite adem&#225;s construir el edificio de la [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Agencia de inteligencia[COLOR_REVERT] y la maravilla del mundo de [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Scotland Yard[COLOR_REVERT]. El primero en investigar el [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Comunismo[COLOR_REVERT] recibe un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gran esp&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT] gratis.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_CALENDAR_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Calendar[COLOR_REVERT] allows your workers to construct [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Plantation[COLOR_REVERT] improvements, enabling you to access various valuable resources. It allows construction of the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Mausoleum of Maussollos[COLOR_REVERT] wonder.</English>
+		<French>Le [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Calendrier[COLOR_REVERT] permet &#224; vos ouvriers de construire des [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Plantations[COLOR_REVERT] qui donnent acc&#232;s &#224; diverses ressources. Elle permet la construction de la merveille [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Mausol&#233;e d'Halicarnasse[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
+		<German>Dank dem [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Kalender[COLOR_REVERT] k&#246;nnen die Bautrupps Modernisierungen an [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Plantagen[COLOR_REVERT] vornehmen, so dass Sie wertvolle Ressourcen erhalten. Der Bau des Wunders [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Mausoleum von Halikarnassos[COLOR_REVERT] wird erm&#246;glicht.</German>
+		<Italian>Il [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Calendario[COLOR_REVERT] permette ai lavoratori di costruire i miglioramenti [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]piantagioni[COLOR_REVERT], che permettono di accedere a diverse risorse. Inoltre permette la costruzione della Meraviglia [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Mausoleo di Mausolo[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
+		<Spanish>El [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Calendario[COLOR_REVERT] permite a los trabajadores construir la mejora de las [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Plantaciones[COLOR_REVERT], lo que permite acceder a varios recursos valiosos. Tambi&#233;n permite construir la maravilla del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Mausoleo de Mausolo[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_CHEMISTRY_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemistry[COLOR_REVERT] allows construction of [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Privateers[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Frigates[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomy[COLOR_REVERT]). It also increases production from all workshops by 1.</English>
+		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimie[COLOR_REVERT] permet la construction de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsaires[COLOR_REVERT] et de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fr&#233;gates[COLOR_REVERT] (avec l'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]astronomie[COLOR_REVERT]). Elle augmente aussi de + 1 la production de tous les ateliers.</French>
+		<German>Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemie[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht den Bau von [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Freibeutern[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fregatten[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomie[COLOR_REVERT]). Die Produktion aller Werkst&#228;tten steigt au&#223;erdem um 1.</German>
+		<Italian>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimica[COLOR_REVERT] permette la realizzazione di [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]navi corsare[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]fregate[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme all'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomia[COLOR_REVERT]). Inoltre aumenta la produzione di tutte le botteghe di 1.</Italian>
+		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Qu&#237;mica[COLOR_REVERT] permite la creaci&#243;n de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsarios[COLOR_REVERT] y [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fragatas[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronom&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT]). Tambi&#233;n aumenta en 1 la producci&#243;n de todos los talleres.</Spanish>
+	</TEXT>
+	<TEXT>
+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_ARTILLERY_STRATEGY</Tag>
+		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Artillery[COLOR_REVERT] allows you to build [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Artillery[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Anti-Tank Infantry[COLOR_REVERT], and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Mobile Artillery[COLOR_REVERT], the game's most powerful siege unit.</English>
